module stall
facts:
  sold: int from 0 to 99   // what Otto has sold tonight

== open
OTTO: Needles, thread, buttons!
{ owes(miller) > 0 } OTTO: And you still owe me {owes(miller)}, Mrs Miller.
MILLER: A card of needles. Put it on the slate.
* Let her owe it.
  [owes(miller) += price(needles)]
  [sell(needles, miller)]
  [sold += 1]
  <-
* Tell her it's money tonight.
  OTTO: Money tonight. The slate's full.
  <-
